<!--
  One word for each thing. An NFT is the object; "ticket" is its job at a door. A collection is
  a set of NFTs, and its ticket types are what its maker called them. NFTs are minted, sent,
  listed for sale, sold and bought; a guest is admitted. Sats are withdrawn. The app is "this app".
-->
